From d22b4263bba24e950323550df07beedfcfd7027b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 11:12:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: qcom: add asynchronous FC4 AWB inference and AE
 motion

Add asynchronous ONNX Runtime execution for the FC4 AWB and rear scene classifier models, IQM postprocessing and history state tracking with module EEPROM calibration, generated FC4 DNN tuning tables, and AE motion exposure compensation.
